    "body": "I had a look at the fedora bashrc, and it looks it will avoid installing the default prompt if something else was already enabled. Please try initializing the starship prompt before the global bashrc is sourced. Though on my system starship is successfully able to replace it. Is it possible your starship binary isn't included in `PATH` in your bashrc?",
